aring; separate by index, filters or spaces."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué aporta un Calculated Insight como \"valor de vida del cliente\" a un agente?","options":["Un tema nuevo que se crea automáticamente","Una regla de colaboración por cliente","Permisos adicionales para modificar pedidos del cliente","Contexto para personalizar respuestas u ofertas"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Los insights enriquecen el contexto del agente.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does a Calculated Insight like customer lifetime value give an agent?","options":["A new auto-created topic","A sharing rule per customer","Extra permissions to modify the customer's orders","Context to personalize replies or offers"],"explanation":"Insights enrich the agent's context."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de Calculated Insight se actualiza casi en tiempo real?","options":["Insight por lotes programado una vez al mes","Insight en streaming","Insight manual que ejecuta el administrador","Insight archivado"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Los streaming insights procesan datos en ventanas cortas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which Calculated Insight type updates near real time?","options":["Batch insight scheduled monthly","Streaming insight","Manual insight run by the admin","Archived insight"],"explanation":"Streaming insights process data in short windows."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué objeto de Data Cloud se usa normalmente como raíz de un data graph de cliente?","options":["Segmento de marketing activo","Data stream de CRM","Retriever de Knowledge","Individual unificado (Unified Individual)"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"El perfil unificado suele ser la raíz de los data graphs de cliente.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which Data Cloud object is usually the root of a customer data graph?","options":["An active marketing segment","A CRM data stream","A Knowledge retriever","Unified Individual"],"explanation":"The unified profile is usually the root of customer 