Let the model choose"],"explanation":"Contradictory content yields inconsistent answers."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué es la activación en Data Cloud?","options":["Activar la Trust Layer","Activar una versión de agente","Enviar segmentos o datos a sistemas de destino","Activar una plantilla"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"La activación publica audiencias a destinos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What is activation in Data Cloud?","options":["Enabling the Trust Layer","Activating an agent version","Sending segments or data to target systems","Activating a template"],"explanation":"Activation publishes audiences to destinations."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ventaja tiene usar Data Cloud para auditar conversaciones de agentes?","options":["Que cambia el modelo","Analizar y consultar los datos de auditoría","Que nadie puede verlos","Que se borran automáticamente"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Los datos pueden consultarse y usarse en informes.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's the benefit of using Data Cloud to audit agent conversations?","options":["It changes the model","Analyzing and querying audit data","Nobody can see them","They auto-delete"],"explanation":"Data can be queried and used in reports."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué consideración hay al indexar contenido con imágenes o tablas complejas?","options":["No se puede subir","Se indexa perfectamente siempre sin pérdida","Se convierte en vídeo","Puede necesitar preprocesado para extraer texto útil"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"El texto extraído determina lo recuperable.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's a consideration when indexing content with images or complex tables?","options":["It can't be uploaded","It always indexes perfectly with no loss","It becomes video","It may need preprocessing to extract useful text"],"explanation":"Extracted text determines what's retrievable."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dato de Data Cloud permite a un agente saber el último pedido online de un cliente?","options":["Un DMO de pedidos de la fuente de comercio","El perfil del usuario","El campo descripción de la cuenta en CRM","El historial de Chatter"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Los datos de comercio ingeridos y unificados.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which Data Cloud data tells an agent a customer's last online order?","options":["An order DMO from the commerce source","The user profile","The CRM account description","Chatter history"],"explanation":"Ingested, unified commerce data."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos riesgos reduce una buena gobernanza de datos para Agentforce? (Elige 2)","options":["Que el canal se cierre","Que el agente tenga demasiados colores","Que falten licencias de Chatter","Exposición de datos sensibles","Respuestas basadas en datos erróneos"],"correct":[3,4],"explanation":"Gobernanza = calidad y seguridad.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two risks does good data governance reduce for Agentforce? (Choose 2)","options":["Channel closing","Too many agent colors","Missing Chatter licenses","Sensitive data exposure","Answers based on bad data"],"explanation":"Governance = quality and security."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué permite el conector de Amazon S3 en Data Cloud para un agente?","options":["Ejecutar Apex en S3","Copiar usuarios","Ingerir archivos para indexarlos","Alojar el agente en AWS"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Archivos en S3 pueden alimentar UDMOs.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does the Amazon S3 connector allow for an agent?","options":["Running Apex in S3","Copying users","Ingesting files to index","Hosting the agent on AWS"],"explanation":"S3 files can feed UDMOs."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene configurar para que un retriever priorice contenido reciente?","options":["Una temperatura alta","Filtros o campos de fecha en la recuperación","Un tema nuevo","Una regla de validación"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Filtrar por vigencia evita información caducada.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What should be set so a retriever prioritizes recent content?","options":["High temperature","Date filters or fields in retrieval","A new topic","A validation rule"],"explanation":"Filtering by validity avoids stale info."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica un Unified Individual con demasiados registros de origen enlazados?","options":["Que el cliente es muy activo","Que el índice está vacío","Reglas de coincidencia demasiado amplias","Que falta Trust Layer"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Reglas laxas fusionan personas distintas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does a Unified Individual with too many linked source records suggest?","options":["The customer is very active","The index is empty","Overly broad match rules","Trust Layer is missing"],"explanation":"Loose rules merge different people."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de agente se beneficia más de los segmentos de Data Cloud?","options":["Agentes de marketing o ventas proactivas","Agentes desactivados","Agentes sin acciones","Ninguno"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Los segmentos identifican audiencias para acciones proactivas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which agent type benefits most from Data Cloud segments?","options":["Marketing or proactive sales agents","Deactivated agents","Agents with no actions","None"],"explanation":"Segments identify audiences for proactive action."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué recomienda Salesforce al empezar con RAG en Agentforce?","options":["Evitar Knowledge","Construir a mano cada componente desde el primer día","No probar","Empezar con Agentforce Data Library"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"ADL simplifica la configuración inicial.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does Salesforce recommend when starting with RAG in Agentforce?","options":["Avoid Knowledge","Hand-build every component from day one","Skip testing","Start with Agentforce Data Library"],"explanation":"ADL simplifies initial setup."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica la fidelidad (faithfulness) de una respuesta RAG?","options":["Que tarda poco","Que usa muchos emojis","Que se basa en el contexto recuperado","Que es lo más larga posible"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Una respuesta fiel no añade datos inventados.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does RAG answer faithfulness indicate?","options":["It's fast","It uses many emojis","It's based on retrieved context","It's as long as possible"],"explanation":"A faithful answer adds no invented data."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos elementos se definen al crear un índice de búsqueda? (Elige 2)","options":["Tema del agente","Objeto y campos a indexar","Configuración de troceado y embeddings","Perfil del usuario del agente","Plantilla de correo"],"correct":[1,2],"explanation":"Fuente, campos, chunking y modelo de vectores.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two items are defined when creating a search index? (Choose 2)","options":["Agent topic","Object and fields to index","Chunking and embedding settings","Agent user profile","Email template"],"explanation":"Source, fields, chunking and vector model."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ocurre con los datos de CRM ingeridos en Data Cloud si se borran en CRM?","options":["Se borra Data Cloud entero","Se reflejan según la sincronización del conector","Se crea un caso","Se mantienen siempre sin cambios"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"El conector sincroniza cambios y borrados.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What happens to CRM data in Data Cloud if deleted in CRM?","options":["All Data Cloud is deleted","It's reflected per connector sync","A case is created","It always stays unchanged"],"explanation":"The connector syncs changes and deletes."}}},{"domain":"D3","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de consulta usa un agente para obtener el saldo exacto de una cuenta?","options":["Un resumen del modelo","Un retriever de Knowledge","Una acción con consulta estructurada","Una búsqueda semántica en documentos"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Datos exactos requieren consultas deterministas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which query does an agent use for an account's exact balance?","options":["A model summary","A Knowledge retriever","An action with a structured query","A semantic document search"],"explanation":"Exact data needs deterministic queries."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Dónde se recomienda construir y probar un agente antes de producción?","options":["En una organización de prueba gratuita sin relación con la empresa","Directamente en producción con el agente desactivado y datos reales de clientes","En la organización de un partner externo con acceso compartido","En una sandbox"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Las sandboxes permiten probar con seguridad antes de desplegar.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Where is it recommended to build and test an agent before production?","options":["In an unrelated free trial org","Directly in production with the agent off and real customer data","In an external partner's org with shared access","In a sandbox"],"explanation":"Sandboxes allow safe testing before deploying."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de sandbox es más adecuado para pruebas realistas de un agente con datos completos?","options":["Full o Partial Copy","Developer, porque copia todos los datos de producción en cada actualización","Developer Pro sin datos, que replica los volúmenes de producción","Scratch org sin configuración de Data Cloud"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Full/Partial incluyen datos; Developer solo metadatos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which sandbox type suits realistic agent testing with full data?","options":["Full or Partial Copy","Developer, since it copies all production data each refresh","Data-less Developer Pro that mirrors production volumes","A scratch org with no Data Cloud setup"],"explanation":"Full/Partial include data; Developer only metadata."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de metadato representa el agente y su planificador en la Metadata API?","options":["FlexiPage","ApexClass con el código del motor","GenAiPlannerBundle (o GenAiPlanner)","CustomObject del objeto agente con sus campos"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"El planner bundle agrupa la definición del agente y sus temas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which metadata type represents the agent and its planner in the Metadata API?","options":["FlexiPage","ApexClass with the engine code","GenAiPlannerBundle (or GenAiPlanner)","CustomObject of the agent object with its fields"],"explanation":"The planner bundle groups the agent definition and topics."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de metadato representa un tema del agente?","options":["GenAiPlugin","Flow","CustomMetadata con un registro por tema","GenAiPromptTemplate, que guarda los temas como plantillas"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Topics se despliegan como GenAiPlugin.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which metadata type represents an agent topic?","options":["GenAiPlugin","Flow","CustomMetadata with one record per topic","GenAiPromptTemplate, which stores topics as templates"],"explanation":"Topics deploy as GenAiPlugin."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de metadato representa una acción de agente?","options":["QuickAction del objeto relacionado","CustomPermission","GenAiFunction","GenAiPlugin, que también guarda cada acción como tema"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Las acciones se despliegan como GenAiFunction.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which metadata type represents an agent action?","options":["The related object's QuickAction","CustomPermission","GenAiFunction","GenAiPlugin, which also stores each action as a topic"],"explanation":"Actions deploy as GenAiFunction."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de metadato representa una plantilla de prompt?","options":["Document","StaticResource con el texto del prompt","EmailTemplate con el tipo de plantilla Lightning","GenAiPromptTemplate"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Prompt templates se despliegan como GenAiPromptTemplate.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which metadata type represents a prompt template?","options":["Document","StaticResource holding the prompt text","EmailTemplate of Lightning template type","GenAiPromptTemplate"],"explanation":"Prompt templates deploy as GenAiPromptTemplate."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos herramientas sirven para desplegar agentes entre organizaciones? (Elige 2)","options":["Salesforce CLI / Metadata API","Copiar y pegar la configuración en el constructor","Data Loader exportando el objeto agente a CSV","El Import Wizard de objetos personalizados","DevOps Center o change sets"],"correct":[0,4],"explanation":"Metadatos vía CLI, DevOps Center, change sets o paquetes.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two tools deploy agents between orgs? (Choose 2)","options":["Salesforce CLI / Metadata API","Copy-pasting config into the builder","Data Loader exporting the agent object to CSV","The custom object Import Wizard","DevOps Center or change sets"],"explanation":"Metadata via CLI, DevOps Center, change sets or packages."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"Al desplegar un agente de servicio, ¿qué debe existir en la organización de destino?","options":["La misma zona horaria del administrador","El mismo número de usuarios que en la sandbox","El usuario del agente y sus permisos","Las conversaciones de prueba de la sandbox con sus transcripciones"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"El agent user no se despliega como metadato; hay que crearlo y asignar permisos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"When deploying a service agent, what must exist in the target org?","options":["The admin's same time zone","The same number of users as the sandbox","The agent user and its permissions","The sandbox test conversations and transcripts"],"explanation":"The agent user isn't deployed as metadata; create it and assign permissions."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dependencias hay que incluir al desplegar un agente con acciones?","options":["Los informes de uso del agente en la sandbox","Flujos, clases Apex y plantillas que usan las acciones","Las vistas de lista del objeto caso","Solo el agente, porque las dependencias se crean solas en destino"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Las acciones referencian recursos que deben existir en destino.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which dependencies must be included when deploying an agent with actions?","options":["The agent's sandbox usage reports","Flows, Apex classes and templates the actions use","Case list views","Only the agent, since dependencies auto-create in the target"],"explanation":"Actions reference resources that must exist in the target."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué hay que hacer tras desplegar un agente a producción?","options":["Borrar la versión de la sandbox para que no haya conflicto","Nada: queda activo automáticamente con los mismos canales","Reiniciar la organización","Revisar la configuración y activarlo"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Se revisan permisos, canales y se activa en destino.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What must be done after deploying an agent to production?","options":["Delete the sandbox version to avoid conflict","Nothing: it's auto-active with the same channels","Restart the org","Review the configuration and activate it"],"explanation":"Review permissions and channels, then activate in the target."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué herramienta permite crear y ejecutar pruebas por lotes de un agente?","options":["Lightning App Builder","Agentforce Testing Center","El Developer Console con consultas SOQL","Apex Test Execution con clases de prueba del motor"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Testing Center ejecuta casos con resultados esperados.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which tool creates and runs batch tests for an agent?","options":["Lightning App Builder","Agentforce Testing Center","Developer Console with SOQL queries","Apex Test Execution with engine test classes"],"explanation":"Testing Center runs cases with expected outcomes."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué se define en un caso de prueba de Testing Center? (Elige 2)","options":["El color del agente","La frase del usuario","El perfil del administrador que ejecuta la prueba","El tema y las acciones esperados","La carpeta de informes de destino"],"correct":[1,3],"explanation":"Utterance, tema esperado, acciones esperadas y respuesta esperada.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What is defined in a Testing Center test case? (Choose 2)","options":["The agent color","The user utterance","The admin profile running the test","The expected topic and actions","The target report folder"],"explanation":"Utterance, expected topic, actions and response."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Cómo se pueden crear casos de prueba en Testing Center de forma rápida?","options":["Solo desde la Metadata API","Copiándolos desde el historial de inicios de sesión","Cargando un CSV o generándolos con IA","Escribiéndolos uno a uno en el código Apex del agente"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Testing Center admite CSV y generación de casos con IA.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"How can Testing Center test cases be created quickly?","options":["Only via the Metadata API","Copying them from login history","Uploading a CSV or generating them with AI","Writing them one by one in the agent's Apex code"],"explanation":"Testing Center supports CSV and AI-generated cases."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué consideración tiene ejecutar pruebas en Testing Center respecto a los datos?","options":["Las pruebas solo funcionan en producción","Las pruebas no consumen créditos","Las acciones pueden ejecutarse y cambiar datos","Las pruebas siempre usan datos simulados sin tocar registros"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Por eso se recomienda probar en sandbox.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's a data consideration when running Testing Center tests?","options":["Tests only work in production","Tests consume no credits","Actions may run and change data","Tests always use mock data and touch no records"],"explanation":"Hence testing in a sandbox is recommended."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de metadato guarda las definiciones de prueba de un agente para desplegarlas?","options":["CustomLabel","Report","ApexTestSuite con los casos de prueba","AiEvaluationDefinition"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Las pruebas de agentes se definen como AiEvaluationDefinition.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which metadata type stores agent test definitions for deployment?","options":["CustomLabel","Report","ApexTestSuite with the test cases","AiEvaluationDefinition"],"explanation":"Agent tests are defined as AiEvaluationDefinition."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué comando de Salesforce CLI ejecuta pruebas de agentes?","options":["sf apex run test con el nombre del agente","sf org open","sf agent test run","sf data query sobre el objeto agente"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"El plugin de agentes del CLI incluye comandos de prueba.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which Salesforce CLI command runs agent tests?","options":["sf apex run test with the agent name","sf org open","sf agent test run","sf data query on the agent object"],"explanation":"The CLI agent plugin includes test commands."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ventaja tiene integrar las pruebas de agentes en CI/CD?","options":["Detectar regresiones antes de desplegar","Que el agente no consume créditos","Que se evita tener que activar el agente en producción","Que se saltan los permisos"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Pruebas automáticas en cada cambio.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's the benefit of integrating agent tests into CI/CD?","options":["Catching regressions before deploying","The agent consumes no credits","Avoiding activating the agent in production","Permissions are skipped"],"explanation":"Automated tests on every change."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"Un agente funciona en sandbox pero en producción no responde con Knowledge. ¿Qué se revisa?","options":["El tono","Data Library e índice en producción","La temperatura de las plantillas en la sandbox","El nombre del agente"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Los componentes de Data Cloud e índices deben existir y estar construidos en destino.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"An agent works in sandbox but in production doesn't answer with Knowledge. What's checked?","options":["Tone","Data Library and index in production","Template temperature in the sandbox","The agent name"],"explanation":"Data Cloud components and indexes must exist and be built in the target."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Cómo se trasladan configuraciones de Data Cloud entre organizaciones?","options":["Copiándolas a mano siempre","Con Data Loader exportando DMOs","No se pueden trasladar","Con data kits o paquetes"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Los data kits empaquetan streams, mapeos y otros componentes.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"How are Data Cloud configurations moved between orgs?","options":["Always copying by hand","With Data Loader exporting DMOs","They can't be moved","With data kits or packages"],"explanation":"Data kits package streams, mappings and other components."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué hay que habilitar en una sandbox nueva para construir agentes?","options":["Einstein generativo y Agentforce","Solo la autenticación multifactor","Nada: se heredan siempre activados de producción","El año fiscal personalizado"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Algunas funciones deben activarse tras crear o actualizar la sandbox.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What must be enabled in a new sandbox to build agents?","options":["Generative Einstein and Agentforce","Only MFA","Nothing: always inherited enabled from production","Custom fiscal year"],"explanation":"Some features must be enabled after creating or refreshing a sandbox."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué estrategia permite volver atrás rápido si una nueva versión del agente falla?","options":["Reactivar la versión anterior","Desactivar la Trust Layer","Restaurar una copia de toda la organización","Borrar el agente y crear uno nuevo desde cero"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Las versiones permiten rollback.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which strategy allows a quick rollback if a new agent version fails?","options":["Reactivate the previous version","Disable the Trust Layer","Restore a full org backup","Delete the agent and build a new one"],"explanation":"Versions allow rollback."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos actividades forman parte de la supervisión tras el despliegue? (Elige 2)","options":["Borrar las conversaciones a diario","Cambiar el OWD de todos los objetos cada semana","Revisar analíticas de uso y resolución","Desactivar el agente cada noche","Revisar feedback y auditoría"],"correct":[2,4],"explanation":"Se supervisa rendimiento, calidad y seguridad.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two activities are part of post-deployment monitoring? (Choose 2)","options":["Deleting conversations daily","Changing every object's OWD weekly","Reviewing usage and resolution analytics","Deactivating the agent nightly","Reviewing feedback and audit"],"explanation":"Monitor performance, quality and safety."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué herramienta centraliza la supervisión de agentes en producción?","options":["Schema Builder","El Setup Audit Trail de la organización","Agentforce Command Center","El Import Wizard"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Command Center muestra salud, métricas y conversaciones.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which tool centralizes production agent monitoring?","options":["Schema Builder","The org's Setup Audit Trail","Agentforce Command Center","The Import Wizard"],"explanation":"Command Center shows health, metrics and conversations."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene hacer antes de una actualización de versión de Salesforce que afecta a Agentforce?","options":["Nada","Probar los agentes en una sandbox preview","Desactivar todos los agentes hasta la siguiente versión","Borrar las plantillas"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Las sandboxes preview permiten validar cambios de release.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What should be done before a Salesforce release affecting Agentforce?","options":["Nothing","Test agents in a preview sandbox","Deactivate all agents until the next release","Delete templates"],"explanation":"Preview sandboxes validate release changes."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de despliegue permite distribuir un agente a muchas organizaciones de clientes?","options":["Un paquete gestionado","Un change set enviado a cada cliente","Un correo con capturas","Una exportación de Data Loader"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Los partners distribuyen agentes con paquetes (p. ej. en AgentExchange).","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which deployment approach distributes an agent to many customer orgs?","options":["A managed package","A change set sent to each customer","An email with screenshots","A Data Loader export"],"explanation":"Partners distribute agents via packages (e.g. AgentExchange)."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ocurre si se despliega una acción de flujo pero el flujo está inactivo en destino?","options":["La acción no funcionará","El agente activa el flujo automáticamente","El flujo se ejecuta igualmente","Se crea un flujo nuevo"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Los flujos referenciados deben estar activos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What happens if a flow action is deployed but the flow is inactive in the target?","options":["The action won't work","The agent auto-activates the flow","The flow runs anyway","A new flow is created"],"explanation":"Referenced flows must be active."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica una buena práctica de gestión de versiones de agentes?","options":["Documentar cambios de cada versión","No probar versiones","Mantener una sola versión sin historial","Editar siempre la versión activa sin registro"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"El historial facilita auditoría y rollback.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's a good agent version management practice?","options":["Document each version's changes","Don't test versions","Keep one version with no history","Always edit the active version with no record"],"explanation":"History eases audit and rollback."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de entorno de Salesforce sirve para que un desarrollador pruebe Agent Script de forma aislada?","options":["Ninguno","Producción con usuarios reales","Una organización de otro cliente","Una scratch org o sandbox de desarrollo"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Entornos aislados para desarrollo y pruebas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which environment lets a developer test Agent Script in isolation?","options":["None","Production with real users","Another customer's org","A scratch org or developer sandbox"],"explanation":"Isolated environments for development and testing."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos riesgos tiene activar un agente sin pruebas suficientes? (Elige 2)","options":["Que se borren los perfiles","Que la organización cambie de edición","Que se desactive Chatter","Acciones no deseadas sobre datos","Respuestas incorrectas a clientes"],"correct":[3,4],"explanation":"Probar reduce errores y efectos indeseados.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two risks come from activating an under-tested agent? (Choose 2)","options":["Profiles getting deleted","The org changing edition","Chatter being disabled","Unwanted data actions","Wrong answers to customers"],"explanation":"Testing reduces errors and side effects."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué comando de Salesforce CLI permite recuperar los metadatos de un agente desde una organización?","options":["sf org list","sf apex run","sf data export tree","sf project retrieve start"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Retrieve trae los metadatos (GenAiPlannerBundle, etc.).","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which Salesforce CLI command retrieves an agent's metadata from an org?","options":["sf org list","sf apex run","sf data export tree","sf project retrieve start"],"explanation":"Retrieve brings metadata (GenAiPlannerBundle, etc.)."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué comando despliega metadatos de agentes a una organización?","options":["sf project deploy start","sf data import tree","sf org create user","sf agent preview"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Deploy envía los metadatos al destino.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which command deploys agent metadata to an org?","options":["sf project deploy start","sf data import tree","sf org create user","sf agent preview"],"explanation":"Deploy sends metadata to the target."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué permite el comando sf agent preview?","options":["Borrar conversaciones","Conversar con un agente desde la línea de comandos","Desplegar el agente a producción sin pruebas","Cambiar el modelo"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Permite probar interactivamente un agente vía CLI.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does sf agent preview allow?","options":["Deleting conversations","Chatting with an agent from the command line","Deploying the agent to production without tests","Changing the model"],"explanation":"It lets you test an agent interactively via CLI."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué consideración tienen los canales de mensajería al desplegar?","options":["Se despliegan siempre activos con el agente sin pasos adicionales","No son necesarios en producción","Se crean solos","Deben configurarse y conectarse en destino"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Messaging channels, deployments y flujos de Omni-Channel requieren configuración.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What consideration do messaging channels have when deploying?","options":["They always deploy active with the agent, no extra steps","They're not needed in production","They self-create","They must be configured and connected in the target"],"explanation":"Messaging channels, deployments and Omni-Channel flows need setup."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de análisis de Testing Center ayuda a evaluar la respuesta además del tema y acción?","options":["Conteo de usuarios activos","Análisis de licencias","Medición del tamaño del archivo de pruebas","Evaluación de la respuesta frente a la esperada"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Testing Center evalúa respuestas con criterios (p. ej. LLM-as-judge).","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which Testing Center analysis evaluates the response besides topic and action?","options":["Counting active users","License analysis","Measuring test file size","Evaluating the response against the expected one"],"explanation":"Testing Center evaluates responses with criteria (e.g. LLM-as-judge)."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué recomienda Salesforce para el volumen de casos de prueba?","options":["Solo frases perfectas","Solo un caso por agente","No probar casos negativos","Cubrir casos frecuentes, límite y negativos"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Cobertura amplia incluye intentos fuera de ámbito.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does Salesforce recommend for test case volume?","options":["Only perfect utterances","One case per agent","Skip negative cases","Cover common, edge and negative cases"],"explanation":"Broad coverage includes off-scope attempts."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica una prueba fallida por tema incorrecto?","options":["Que la sandbox está caducada","Que el usuario del agente no tiene licencia","Que hay que subir la temperatura","Revisar descripciones de clasificación"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"La clasificación depende de las descripciones.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does a test failing on wrong topic indicate?","options":["The sandbox expired","The agent user has no license","Raise temperature","Review classification descriptions"],"explanation":"Classification depends on descriptions."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos permisos o elementos suelen olvidarse al desplegar un agente? (Elige 2)","options":["Acceso a clases Apex o flujos","Crear un año fiscal nuevo","Cambiar el logotipo de la organización","Cambiar el idioma corporativo","Asignar conjuntos de permisos al usuario del agente"],"correct":[0,4],"explanation":"Permisos de ejecución de acciones son críticos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two items are often forgotten when deploying an agent? (Choose 2)","options":["Apex class or flow access","Creating a new fiscal year","Changing the org logo","Changing the corporate language","Assigning permission sets to the agent user"],"explanation":"Action execution permissions are critical."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ventaja tiene DevOps Center para equipos que construyen agentes?","options":["Control de cambios con Git y pipelines","Que evita usar sandboxes","Que activa agentes sin probar","Que despliega sin metadatos"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"DevOps Center gestiona trabajo, ramas y promociones.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's DevOps Center's benefit for teams building agents?","options":["Change control with Git and pipelines","It avoids sandboxes","It activates agents untested","It deploys without metadata"],"explanation":"DevOps Center manages work items, branches and promotions."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué hay que revisar en las plantillas de prompt al pasar de sandbox a producción?","options":["Que se hayan borrado en sandbox","Que la versión correcta esté activa","Que no tengan descripción","Que tengan temperatura máxima"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Las versiones activas deben comprobarse en destino.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What must be checked in prompt templates moving from sandbox to production?","options":["That they were deleted in sandbox","That the right version is active","That they have no description","That they have max temperature"],"explanation":"Active versions must be checked in the target."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué estrategia de lanzamiento reduce riesgos al poner un agente nuevo en producción?","options":["No comunicarlo","Activarlo para todos los canales a la vez sin supervisión","Despliegue gradual a una parte del tráfico","Lanzarlo en temporada alta sin pruebas"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Un piloto o despliegue progresivo limita el impacto.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which launch strategy reduces risk for a new production agent?","options":["Don't communicate it","Activate on all channels at once unmonitored","Gradual rollout to part of the traffic","Launch in peak season untested"],"explanation":"A pilot or phased rollout limits impact."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dato ayuda a decidir si ampliar un agente piloto?","options":["El tamaño del logotipo","El número de colores del chat","Métricas de resolución y satisfacción","Los perfiles"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Resultados medidos justifican la ampliación.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which data helps decide whether to expand a pilot agent?","options":["Logo size","Chat color count","Resolution and satisfaction metrics","Profiles"],"explanation":"Measured results justify expansion."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ocurre al actualizar (refresh) una sandbox con un agente en desarrollo?","options":["Nada","Se despliega a producción","Se conserva todo el trabajo de la sandbox","Se sobrescribe con la configuración de producción"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Hay que guardar el trabajo en control de versiones antes.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What happens when refreshing a sandbox with an agent in development?","options":["Nothing","It deploys to production","All sandbox work is kept","It's overwritten with production config"],"explanation":"Save work to version control first."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de prueba verifica que un agente no revela información de otros clientes?","options":["Pruebas de color","Pruebas negativas y de seguridad","Pruebas de carga del canal","Ninguna"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Probar intentos de acceso indebido e inyección.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which test verifies an agent doesn't reveal other customers' data?","options":["Color tests","Negative and security tests","Channel load tests","None"],"explanation":"Test improper access and injection attempts."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos aspectos conviene vigilar del consumo tras el despliegue? (Elige 2)","options":["Uso de créditos o conversaciones","Número de reglas de validación","Tamaño del logotipo","Color del tema","Picos por canal o tema"],"correct":[0,4],"explanation":"Controlar el consumo evita sorpresas de coste.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two consumption aspects should be watched after deployment? (Choose 2)","options":["Credit or conversation usage","Number of validation rules","Logo size","Topic color","Spikes by channel or topic"],"explanation":"Tracking consumption avoids cost surprises."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica el análisis de frases sin tema (unmatched utterances)?","options":["Necesidades no cubiertas por el agente","Que el canal está caído","Nada","Que el usuario no tiene permisos"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Ayuda a priorizar nuevos temas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What do unmatched utterances indicate?","options":["Needs the agent doesn't cover","The channel is down","Nothing","The user lacks permissions"],"explanation":"They help prioritize new topics."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene hacer con conversaciones reales problemáticas detectadas en producción?","options":["Publicarlas","Borrarlas","Añadirlas como casos de prueba","Ignorarlas"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Alimentan las pruebas de regresión.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What to do with problematic real conversations found in production?","options":["Publish them","Delete them","Add them as test cases","Ignore them"],"explanation":