for all users","Inventory reusable flows and Apex"],"explanation":"Reusing proven logic speeds up and reduces risk."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de pruebas se hacen con usuarios reales antes del lanzamiento general?","options":["Pruebas de carga del servidor de correo","Pruebas unitarias de Apex con cobertura mínima del 75 por ciento","Pruebas de aceptación de usuario (UAT)","Pruebas de recuperación ante desastres de la organización"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"UAT valida que el agente cumple las expectativas de negocio.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which testing is done with real users before general launch?","options":["Mail server load tests","Apex unit tests with 75 percent minimum coverage","User acceptance testing (UAT)","Org disaster recovery tests"],"explanation":"UAT validates the agent meets business expectations."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué cobertura de pruebas Apex se exige para desplegar clases usadas como acciones a producción?","options":["Un 10 %","Al menos un 75 % de cobertura global","Un 100 % de cada línea de cada clase sin excepción","Ninguna, porque las acciones de agente están exentas de cobertura"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Las reglas de despliegue de Apex se mantienen.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What Apex test coverage is required to deploy classes used as actions to production?","options":["10%","At least 75% overall coverage","100% of every line of every class, no exceptions","None, since agent actions are exempt from coverage"],"explanation":"Apex deployment rules still apply."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"Tras un despliegue, el agente da error de permisos en una acción Apex. ¿Qué se corrige?","options":["El acceso del usuario del agente a la clase","El idioma del agente y el tono configurado","La cobertura de pruebas de la clase en la sandbox de origen","La descripción de clasificación del tema"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Asignar Apex Class Access mediante permission set.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"After deploying, the agent errors on permissions in an Apex action. What's fixed?","options":["The agent user's access to the class","The agent language and configured tone","The class's test coverage in the source sandbox","The topic's classification description"],"explanation":"Grant Apex Class Access via a permission set."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué recomienda Salesforce para separar entornos de desarrollo, pruebas y producción de agentes?","options":["Una ruta de sandboxes con promoción controlada","Usar una única sandbox compartida para desarrollo y UAT sin control","Trabajar todos los administradores directamente en producción a la vez","Copiar la configuración a mano en cada entorno sin registro"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Dev → QA/UAT → producción con control de cambios.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does Salesforce recommend to separate agent dev, test and prod environments?","options":["A sandbox path with controlled promotion","One shared sandbox for dev and UAT with no control","All admins working directly in production at once","Hand-copying config into each environment unrecorded"],"explanation":"Dev → QA/UAT → production with change control."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué riesgo tiene desarrollar el agente directamente en producción?","options":["Impacto en clientes y datos reales","Que el agente funciona más rápido que en una sandbox de pruebas","Que se reducen los costes de consumo a cero","Que no hace falta activar el agente en ningún momento"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Los errores afectan de inmediato a clientes y datos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's the risk of developing the agent directly in production?","options":["Impact on real customers and data","The agent runs faster than in a test sandbox","Consumption costs drop to zero","The agent never needs activating"],"explanation":"Errors immediately affect customers and data."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos componentes de Omni-Channel deben revisarse al desplegar un agente de servicio? (Elige 2)","options":["Diseños de página de la app de ventas","Reglas de validación de todos los objetos estándar","Flujos de enrutamiento","Colas para escalado","Plantillas de correo de marketing"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"El enrutamiento y las colas de escalado deben existir en destino.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two Omni-Channel components must be reviewed when deploying a service agent? (Choose 2)","options":["Sales app page layouts","Validation rules on every standard object","Routing flows","Escalation queues","Marketing email templates"],"explanation":"Routing and escalation queues must exist in the target."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de metadato representa la configuración de despliegue de mensajería para la web?","options":["GenAiPromptTemplate de bienvenida al cliente","Report","EmbeddedServiceConfig y relacionados","ApexTrigger del objeto sesión de mensajería"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Embedded Service deployments definen el chat web.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which metadata type represents the web messaging deployment config?","options":["A customer welcome GenAiPromptTemplate","Report","EmbeddedServiceConfig and related","An ApexTrigger on the messaging session object"],"explanation":"Embedded Service deployments define the web chat."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene comunicar a los agentes humanos al lanzar un agente de IA?","options":["Que no deben revisar las conversaciones transferidas","Que el agente los sustituye completamente desde el primer día","Que deben desactivar Omni-Channel","Cómo y cuándo recibirán escalados"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"La colaboración humano-IA requiere procesos claros.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What should human agents be told when launching an AI agent?","options":["That they shouldn't review transferred chats","That the agent fully replaces them from day one","That they must disable Omni-Channel","How and when they'll receive escalations"],"explanation":"Human-AI collaboration needs clear processes."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indicador de calidad conviene revisar en las primeras semanas de producción?","options":["El número total de campos personalizados del objeto caso","Conversaciones con feedback negativo","El número de usuarios de Chatter Free","El tamaño del índice en megabytes cada hora"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"El feedback negativo señala problemas concretos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which quality indicator should be reviewed in the first production weeks?","options":["The total custom fields on the Case object","Conversations with negative feedback","The number of Chatter Free users","Index size in megabytes hourly"],"explanation":"Negative feedback points to concrete issues."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de cambio en un agente activo requiere una nueva versión?","options":["Cambios en los datos de un cliente","Cambios en temas, instrucciones o acciones","Cambios en la zona horaria de un usuario","Cambios en el contenido de un artículo de Knowledge indexado"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"La configuración del agente se versiona; el contenido de datos no.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which change to an active agent requires a new version?","options":["Changes to a customer's data","Changes to topics, instructions or actions","Changes to a user's time zone","Changes to an indexed Knowledge article's content"],"explanation":"Agent config is versioned; data content isn't."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ventaja tiene usar control de versiones (Git) para los metadatos del agente?","options":["Historial, revisión y recuperación de cambios","Que el agente responde mejor gracias al historial de Git","Que evita tener que probar el agente","Que Git ejecuta el agente en lugar de Salesforce"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Git permite revisar y revertir cambios.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's the benefit of version control (Git) for agent metadata?","options":["History, review and recovery of changes","The agent answers better thanks to Git history","It avoids testing the agent","Git runs the agent instead of Salesforce"],"explanation":"Git allows reviewing and reverting changes."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué hace falta para que un despliegue de agente incluya sus pruebas automáticas?","options":["Nada: las pruebas viajan siempre ocultas dentro del agente","Escribir las pruebas en las instrucciones","Exportar las pruebas a un informe y adjuntarlo","Incluir las definiciones de prueba en el paquete"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"AiEvaluationDefinition se despliega como metadato.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's needed for an agent deployment to include its automated tests?","options":["Nothing: tests always travel hidden inside the agent","Write tests in the instructions","Export tests to a report and attach it","Include the test definitions in the package"],"explanation":"AiEvaluationDefinition deploys as metadata."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos herramientas ayudan a identificar mejoras tras el lanzamiento? (Elige 2)","options":["Las plantillas de correo Classic","Análisis de frases","Revisión de transcripciones","El Import Wizard de leads","El historial de contraseñas"],"correct":[1,2],"explanation":"Analíticas y transcripciones guían la iteración.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two tools help find improvements after launch? (Choose 2)","options":["Classic email templates","Utterance analysis","Transcript review","The leads Import Wizard","Password history"],"explanation":"Analytics and transcripts guide iteration."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ocurre si se desactiva un agente con conversaciones abiertas?","options":["Se reactiva solo","Se borran todas las transcripciones","Dejan de atenderse por el agente","Las conversaciones abiertas siguen con la versión desactivada para siempre"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Hay que planif