 comprueba un despliegue de validación con agentes?","options":["Dependencias y errores de metadatos","El tono de las respuestas","El consumo de créditos","El idioma"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Detecta referencias rotas y errores antes de desplegar.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does a validation deployment with agents check?","options":["Dependencies and metadata errors","Response tone","Credit consumption","Language"],"explanation":"It catches broken references and errors before deploying."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene hacer cuando una acción externa cambia su API?","options":["Esperar a que el agente se adapte solo","Nada","Desactivar la Trust Layer","Actualizar la acción y volver a probar"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Los cambios de integración requieren ajuste y pruebas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What should be done when an external action's API changes?","options":["Wait for the agent to adapt itself","Nothing","Disable the Trust Layer","Update the action and retest"],"explanation":"Integration changes need tuning and tests."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos acciones reducen el riesgo al pasar un agente a producción en una ventana concreta? (Elige 2)","options":["Plan de despliegue con responsables","Plan de vuelta atrás","Desplegar sin avisar a nadie","Desactivar analíticas","Eliminar sandboxes"],"correct":[0,1],"explanation":"Planificación y rollback.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two actions reduce risk when moving an agent to production in a window? (Choose 2)","options":["A deployment plan with owners","A rollback plan","Deploying without telling anyone","Disabling analytics","Deleting sandboxes"],"explanation":"Planning and rollback."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ventaja tiene probar el agente con usuarios internos antes de clientes?","options":["Que se ahorra la activación","Que los clientes no podrán usarlo nunca","Ninguna","Detectar problemas con menos riesgo"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"U