vers and connect agents to them"],"explanation":"MuleSoft lets you create MCP servers from APIs and consume MCP tools."}}},{"domain":"D5","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué es el protocolo Agent-to-Agent (A2A)?","options":["Un canal de mensajería para que los clientes hablen entre sí sin agentes","Un estándar abierto para que agentes de distintos proveedores colaboren","Una regla de asignación que reparte casos entre agentes humanos","Un tipo de tema estándar que transfiere la conversación a otro tema"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"A2A permite descubrir capacidades y delegar tareas entre agentes.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What is the Agent-to-Agent (A2A) protocol?","options":["A messaging channel for customers to talk to each other without agents","An open standard for agents from different vendors to collaborate","An assignment rule distributing cases among human agents","A standard topic type transferring the chat to another topic"],"explanation":"A2A lets agents discover capabilities and delegate tasks."}}},{"domain":"D5","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué describe una tarjeta de agente (Agent Card) en A2A?","options":["Capacidades, endpoint y autenticación del agente","La lista de temas desactivados en versiones anteriores del agente","Las licencias asignadas al usuario del agente en Salesforce","El diseño visual de la ventana de chat que ve el cliente final"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"La Agent Card permite a otros agentes descubrir qué hace y cómo invocarlo.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does an Agent Card describe in A2A?","options":["The agent's capabilities, endpoint and authentication","Topics deactivated in previous agent versions","Licenses assigned to the agent user in Salesforce","The visual design of the chat window the end customer sees"],"explanation":"The Agent Card lets other agents discover what it does and how to call it."}}},{"domain":"D5","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué diferencia principal hay entre MCP y A2A?","options":["MCP es solo para voz y A2A solo para texto","MCP conecta agentes con herramientas; A2A conecta agentes con agentes","MCP conecta agentes entre sí y A2A conecta agentes con bases de datos","Son el mismo protocolo con dos nombres comerciales distintos"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Ambos son complementarios en arquitecturas multiagente.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's the main difference between MCP and A2A?","options":["MCP is voice-only and A2A text-only","MCP connects agents to tools; A2A connects agents to agents","MCP connects agents to each other and A2A connects agents to databases","They're the same protocol under two brand names"],"explanation":"Both are complementary in multi-agent architectures."}}},{"domain":"D5","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué permite la Agent API de Salesforce?","options":["Conversar con un agente de Agentforce desde aplicaciones externas vía REST","Crear temas y acciones nuevas en producción sin pasar por Agentforce Builder","Descargar el modelo de lenguaje para ejecutarlo en servidores propios","Modificar las reglas de colaboración de los objetos que usa el agente"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"La Agent API gestiona sesiones y mensajes con agentes.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does the Salesforce Agent API allow?","options":["Talking to an Agentforce agent from external apps via REST","Creating new topics and actions in production without Agentforce Builder","Downloading the LLM to run on your own servers","Changing sharing rules for the objects the agent uses"],"explanation":"The Agent API manages sessions and messages with agents."}}},{"domain":"D5","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué secuencia típica sigue una integración con la Agent API?","options":["Crear un usuario, borrar el agente y volver a crearlo en cada mensaje","Iniciar sesión, enviar mensajes y cerrar la sesión","Enviar un correo al administrador para que responda manualmente","Exportar el agente a CSV, editarlo y volver a importarlo"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Se crea una sesión, se intercambian mensajes y se finaliza.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What typical sequence does an Agent API integration follow?","options":["Create a user, delete the agent and recreate it each message","Start a session, send messages and end the session","Email the admin to reply manually","Export the agent to CSV, edit and reimport it"],"explanation":"A session is created, messages exchanged, then ended."}}},{"domain":"D5","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué se configura para autenticar una aplicación externa que llama a la Agent API?","options":["El usuario invitado del sitio con permisos de administrador","Una aplicación conectada o de cliente externo con OAuth","Una contraseña compartida escrita en las instrucciones del agente","Un rango de IP de confianza sin ninguna otra credencial"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Se usa OAuth (p. ej. client credentials) con una app conectada/externa.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's set up to authenticate an external app calling the Agent API?","options":["The site guest user with admin permissions","A connected or external client app with OAuth","A shared password written in the agent instructions","A trusted IP range with no other credential"],"explanation":"OAuth (e.g. client credentials) with a connected/external client app is used."}}},{"domain":"D5","source":"bank","stem":"Un agente de Agentforce debe consultar un sistema de inventario expuesto como servidor MCP. ¿Qué se necesita?","options":["Copiar el inventario completo en las instrucciones del tema cada día","Crear un tema por cada producto del inventario con su stock","Registrar el servidor MCP y exponer sus herramientas como acciones","Pedir al cliente que consulte el inventario y pegue el resultado"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Las herramientas MCP se añaden como acciones disponibles para el agente.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"An Agentforce agent must query an inventory system exposed as an MCP server. What's needed?","options":["Paste the full inventory into topic instructions daily","Create a topic per inventory product with its stock","Register the MCP server and expose its tools as actions","Ask the customer to check inventory and paste the result"],"explanation":"MCP tools are added as actions available to the agent."}}},{"domain":"D5","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos ventajas aporta usar estándares abiertos como MCP y A2A? (Elige 2)","options":["Evitar cualquier gobierno o control de seguridad","Menos integraciones a medida","Interoperabilidad con herramientas y agentes de otros proveedores","Garantizar respuestas sin errores del modelo","Eliminar la necesidad de autenticación entre sistemas"],"correct":[1,2],"explanation":"Los estándares reducen integraciones punto a punto.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two benefits do open standards like MCP and A2A bring? (Choose 2)","options":["Avoiding any governance or security control","Fewer custom integrations","Interoperability with other vendors' tools and agents","Guaranteeing error-free model responses","Removing the need for authentication between systems"],"explanation":"Standards reduce point-to-point integrations."}}},{"domain":"D5","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué consideración de seguridad hay al permitir que un agente llame a agentes externos vía A2A?","options":["Usar el mismo usuario administrador en ambos sistemas","Compartir todo el historial del cliente para que el otro agente tenga contexto","Autenticar, autorizar y limitar los datos compartidos","Desactivar la Trust Layer para mejorar la compatibilidad"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"La delegación entre agentes exige control de identidad y datos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's a security consideration when letting an agent call external agents via A2A?","options":["Use the same admin user in both systems","Share the full customer history so the other agent has context","Authenticate, authorize and limit shared data","Disable the Trust Layer to improve compatibility"],"explanation":"Agent delegation requires identity and data control."}}},{"domain":"D5","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué es MuleSoft Agent Fabric?","options":["Un tema estándar de agentes de servicio","Un tejido de red física que conecta los centros de datos de Salesforce","Un tipo de sandbox para probar integraciones de MuleSoft","Capacidades para descubrir, orquestar y gobernar agentes de varios proveedores"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Incluye registro de agentes, broker y gobierno de la red de agentes.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What is MuleSoft Agent Fabric?","options":["A standard service agent topic","A physical network fabric linking Salesforce data centers","A sandbox type for testing MuleSoft integrations","Capabilities to discover, orchestrate and govern multi-vendor agents"],"explanation":"It includes an agent registry, broker and governance of the agent network."}}},{"domain":"D5","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué patrón multiagente usa un agente principal que delega en agentes especialistas?","options":["Un agente por cliente","Orquestador y subagentes","Agentes aislados que nunca se comunican","Un único agente con todos los temas de la empresa sin delegación"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"El orquestador enruta tareas a agentes especializados.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which multi-agent pattern uses a main agent delegating to specialist agents?","options":["One agent per customer","Orchestrator and sub-agents","Isolated agents that never communicate","A single agent with every company topic and no delegation"],"explanation":"The orchestrator routes tasks to specialized agents."}}},{"domain":"D5","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué riesgo tiene encadenar muchos agentes en una sola petición?","options":["Que se eliminan los límites de la plataforma","Que las respuestas son siempre más precisas sin ningún inconveniente","Más latencia, coste y puntos de fallo","Que no hace falta supervisión"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Cada salto añade tiempo, consumo y complejidad.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's the risk of chaining many agents in one request?","options":["Platform limits are removed","Answers are always more accurate with no downside","More latency, cost and failure points","No monitoring is needed"],"explanation":"Each hop adds time, consumption and complexity."}}},{"domain":"D5","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de aplicación externa suele usar la Agent API?","options":["Un informe programado de Salesforce que se envía por correo","Un diseño de página compacto","Una app móvil o web propia de la empresa","Una regla de validación del objeto caso"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Permite integrar agentes en experiencias fuera de Salesforce.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which external application typically uses the Agent API?","options":["A scheduled Salesforce report sent by email","A compact page layout","The company's own mobile or web app","A case validation rule"],"explanation":"It integrates agents into experiences outside Salesforce."}}},{"domain":"D5","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué se necesita en el agente para que la Agent API pueda usarlo?","options":["Que no tenga ningún tema ni acción definidos","Que use el modelo de lenguaje del cliente","Que esté activo y configurado para acceso por API","Que esté desactivado para evitar conflictos con otros canales"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"El agente debe estar activo y la app autorizada.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does the agent need for the Agent API to use it?","options":["To have no topics or actions defined","To use the customer's language model","To be active and set up for API access","To be deactivated to avoid clashing with other channels"],"explanation":"The agent must be active and the app authorized."}}},{"domain":"D5","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ventaja tiene exponer acciones de Salesforce como servidor MCP para otros agentes?","options":["Que se dupliquen los datos fuera de Salesforce automáticamente","Que los agentes externos ignoren los permisos de Salesforce","Reutilizar la lógica de Salesforce desde clientes de IA externos","Que no se necesite autenticación"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"Otros clientes MCP pueden invocar capacidades gobernadas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's the benefit of exposing Salesforce actions as an MCP server for other agents?","options":["Automatically duplicating data outside Salesforce","External agents ignoring Salesforce permissions","Reusing Salesforce logic from external AI clients","No authentication needed"],"explanation":"Other MCP clients can invoke governed capabilities."}}},{"domain":"D5","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos elementos ofrece un servidor MCP a un cliente? (Elige 2)","options":["Recursos o datos","Perfiles de usuario del sistema origen","Herramientas (tools)","Reglas de colaboración de CRM","Licencias de Salesforce para el cliente"],"correct":[0,2],"explanation":"MCP expone tools, resources y prompts.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two items does an MCP server offer a client? (Choose 2)","options":["Resources or data","Source system user profiles","Tools","CRM sharing rules","Salesforce licenses for the client"],"explanation":"MCP exposes tools, resources and prompts."}}},{"domain":"D5","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene supervisar en un sistema multiagente en producción?","options":["El color del icono de cada agente","Trazas de qué agente hizo qué y con qué resultado","Solo el número de agentes creados en la organización","Nada, porque cada agente se supervisa solo"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"La observabilidad de extremo a extremo es clave.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What should be monitored in a production multi-agent system?","options":["Each agent's icon color","Traces of which agent did what and the outcome","Only the number of agents built in the org","Nothing, since each agent monitors itself"],"explanation":"End-to-end observability is key."}}},{"domain":"D5","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué principio debe guiar los datos que un agente envía a un agente externo?","options":["Compartir todo el perfil del cliente por si resulta útil","Compartir las credenciales del usuario del agente","Compartir las instrucciones internas completas","Compartir solo lo necesario para la tarea"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Minimización de datos en la delegación.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which principle should guide data an agent sends to an external agent?","options":["Share the full customer profile in case it helps","Share the agent user's credentials","Share the full internal instructions","Share only what the task needs"],"explanation":"Data minimization in delegation."}}},{"domain":"D5","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica la respuesta de la Agent API además del texto del agente?","options":["Identificadores de sesión y datos de la respuesta","Las contraseñas usadas por las acciones","El historial de todas las sesiones de otros usuarios","El código fuente de los flujos ejecutados"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Incluye IDs de sesión/mensaje y el contenido.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does the Agent API response include besides the agent text?","options":["Session identifiers and response data","Passwords used by actions","All other users' session history","Source code of executed flows"],"explanation":"It includes session/message IDs and content."}}},{"domain":"D5","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué recomienda Salesforce al conectar agentes de terceros a Agentforce?","options":["Darles acceso de administrador para evitar errores","Gobernarlos con registro, permisos y supervisión","Desactivar la auditoría","Conectarlos sin control para acelerar la adopción"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Agent Fabric y la Trust Layer ayudan a gobernar.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does Salesforce recommend when connecting third-party agents to Agentforce?","options":["Give them admin access to avoid errors","Govern them with registry, permissions and monitoring","Disable audit","Connect them uncontrolled to speed adoption"],"explanation":"Agent Fabric and the Trust Layer help govern."}}},{"domain":"D5","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué escenario encaja mejor con A2A que con MCP?","options":["Obtener la hora actual","Leer un registro concreto de una base de datos mediante una herramienta","Ejecutar una consulta SQL simple","Delegar una tarea completa a otro agente autónomo"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"A2A es para colaboración entre agentes; MCP para herramientas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which scenario fits A2A better than MCP?","options":["Getting the current time","Reading one database record via a tool","Running a simple SQL query","Delegating a whole task to another autonomous agent"],"explanation":"A2A is for agent collaboration; MCP for tools."}}},{"domain":"D5","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué elemento de AgentExchange facilita la interoperabilidad?","options":["Agentes, acciones y servidores MCP de partners listos para usar","Un repositorio de contraseñas compartidas entre organizaciones","Un servicio para borrar agentes de otros clientes","Un foro sin componentes instalables"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"El marketplace ofrece componentes reutilizables.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which AgentExchange element eases interoperability?","options":["Ready-made partner agents, actions and MCP servers","A repository of passwords shared across orgs","A service to delete other customers' agents","A forum with no installable components"],"explanation":"The marketplace offers reusable components."}}},{"domain":"D5","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué hay que considerar sobre los límites al usar la Agent API a gran escala?","options":["Que no consume créditos","Que solo admite una sesión al año","Que la Agent API no tiene ningún límite de uso","Límites de API y consumo de la organización"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Como cualquier API, aplica límites y consumo.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What must be considered about limits when using the Agent API at scale?","options":["It consumes no credits","It supports one session a year","The Agent API has no usage limits","Org API limits and consumption"],"explanation":"Like any API, limits and consumption apply."}}}]}$exam$::jsonb);
    raise notice 'Examen salesforce-agentforce-specialist añadido con 500 preguntas.';
  end if;
end
$do$;

select e.code, d.code as dominio, d.name, count(q.id) as preguntas
from public.exams e
join public.domains d on d.exam_id = e.id
left join public.questions q on q.domain_id = d.id
where e.slug = 'salesforce-agentforce-specialist'
group by e.code, d.code, d.name
order by d.code;
